#X text 240 83 Weights the circular harmonics signals according to
the chosen ambisonic optimization. The optimization can be 'basic'
(no optimization) \, 'maxre' or 'inphase'.;
#X text 240 138 If no optimization mode is specified \, the default
is inphase.;
#X text 240 163 Maxre optimization is used when the audience is confined
to the center of the circle.;
#X text 240 203 Inphase optimization is used when the audience covers
the entire circle.;
#X text 240 243 NB: this is theoretical advice — the best choice is
to trust your ears.;
